// Barbarian Village's barbarians at 2011: 17 npcs, 3246-3263 but 3254
// (Hunding), each "Barbarian" in cache 786. Their own names (Alberich ...),
// examines and places are void-634's (barbarian_village.npcs.toml,
// barbarian_outpost.npcs.toml and their npc-spawns); the 2011 wiki (Barbarian,
// 2011-05-18) says each in the village has its own examine text, and
// (Barbarian Village, 2011-05-16) that the town and some of its inhabitants
// were graphically updated with Gunnar's Ground (21 September 2010). Their
// stats are void-634's too, whose profiles give the cache's combat levels but
// 3261's: 15/14/10 with 240 life points (level 17), 15/3/10 with ranged 15 and
// 240 (3259, level 15), 8/7/3 with 180 (level 10), 6/7/3 with 200 (level 9).
// Max hits are the 2011 wiki's (Barbarian, 2011-05-18): 30 for the level 15s
// and 17s, 20 for the 9s and 10s; 289's strength bonus 7 gives 30 at strength
// 14, and -1 gives 20 at strength 7. Each fights with its weapon's animations
// and sounds (void-634 barbarian_village.combat.toml); the weapon is one of
// the npc's models (11788 axe, 11789/11792 warhammer, 11793 sword, 11791
// spear, 11790 bow). Men keep 289's barbarian's defence bonuses, women 289's
// barbarian woman's. All are 289's barbarian category (its battle cry and
// drop table).

[barbarian]
// 3246, void-634's barbarian_alberich: level 17, a two-handed axe (seqs 2067, 3238; synth 1316).
desc=Alberich, a fierce barbarian warrior.
wanderrange=10
maxrange=12
respawnrate=50
hitpoints=240
attack=15
strength=14
defence=10
param=attackrate,6
param=attackbonus,9
param=strengthbonus,7
param=stabdefence,12
param=slashdefence,15
param=crushdefence,13
param=magicdefence,3
param=rangedefence,6
param=damagetype,^crush_style
param=attack_anim,seq_2067
param=defend_anim,seq_3238
param=death_anim,human_death
param=attack_sound,baxe_slash
param=defend_sound,synth_504
param=death_sound,synth_502
category=barbarian

